  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, separating motion commands (controllable) from sensor events (uncontrollable). The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and conservative turn recovery is triggered only on obstacle events. Recovery states allow only one turn direction and never enable forward or random_walk. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or dead-end obstacles. The supervisor always returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
